# Shared types

> Module Legal_types

These enumerations are the typed vocabulary the modules share. They are declared once so
that a claim type or a work state means the same thing in every agreement's scope.

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration ClaimType:
  -- Ordinary
  -- Confidentiality
  -- IpIndemnity
  -- GrossNegligence
  -- UnpaidFees
  -- BodilyInjury

declaration enumeration WorkState:
  -- CA
  -- CO
  -- WA
  -- NY
  -- TX
  -- Other

declaration enumeration Department:
  -- Engineering
  -- Sales
  -- Marketing
  -- Finance
  -- OtherDepartment

declaration enumeration ApprovalLevel:
  -- Manager
  -- Director
  -- VicePresident
  -- ChiefFinancialOfficer

declaration enumeration Separation:
  -- InvoluntaryTermination
  -- QuitWithNotice
  -- QuitWithoutNotice
```
